error[8-0151]: `w_at` needs `mut RawStorage` after its closure's effects are inferred
    ┌─ maybe_mut_raises.fe:246:27
    │
246 │     let g = || { unsafe { w_at(0, x) }.mark() }
    │             --------------^^^^^^^^^^-----------
    │             │             │
    │             │             this call's effects are known only after the closure's body is checked
    │             this closure's effects are inferred from its body, without `mut RawStorage`
    │
    = annotate the types the call depends on in the closure's body, so that it resolves there
